{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1000_p", "source_sha256": "99b2d3b186b3cc917e09c4f62892be863d2f6dd1a9a68b552510b1223de4a18f", "ja": "（PV撮影を終えた亜美が戻ってきた……のだが、\n妙に深刻そうな表情をしている。これは……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "93a46967588e3d039b5219d954d88015b184f0d5ab02d0a1bf0568c78c7622c2", "ja": "兄ちゃん……。亜美ね、見てきちゃったよ。\n5年……10年？　とりあえず未来の亜美たちのこと。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ba595cc1c94d6a2fffb5df19feb3a936543fc7fc9ee421edf94119c41972b4ca", "ja": "え？　未来の？\n……ああ、うん、オーケー。すごいなー。そうなのか。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "482aee8fdc6f23d42f911b5fdb5614e505c356009342c50e95842c2ffbd90537", "ja": "そうなのか、じゃないよー！　もうとにかくタイヘンで\nヘンタイなんだから！　ヘンタイっ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1004_p", "source_sha256": "02960ff3a50c1ec3fe4bc74fdd5c870f39c62982df8821cf9a8919e0df6aef31", "ja": "どさくさ紛れに人聞きの悪いことは言わないように。\nそれで、どんな大変な夢……いや、未来を見たんだ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "317071a8d604b6a4b6dee3c28afa9821daba8f4ace2258d101f33d099d4c0ece", "ja": "あのね、未来の亜美ね、ゼッセーの美女すぎて全世界の\n兄ちゃん姉ちゃんたちがメロンメロンになってた！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "53c336f60ce311be90414697369b3ed0884e07821914acddbbf255b28edf7423", "ja": "毎日世界じゅうから引っ張りだこでね、真美も\n亜美ほどじゃないけど大人気で。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "7e1f6fcbb3a226d5f3bd128022cd738194432e6494e1fc736ce90d5a38700d39", "ja": "さすがの兄ちゃんもプロデュースするどころじゃ\nなくなってて……ひどいよ兄ちゃん！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "b1542dfde113d189ba46e8d7827f898457a1d02e1afb40e33cdbebaecca6ce9e", "ja": "前に亜美のこと、マツダイまでプロデュースして\nくれるって約束したのに！！　ヘンタイっ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6b558f0b8e42021b341e656063e365fffb88c6c609ec56ff67159d1d77cccedd", "ja": "ヘンタイ関係ないだろ……。少なくとも亜美がどれ程\n大人気になったって、投げ出すようなことはないよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9671cfe604216778827d3a5e4e5214cbb460f8f882afd416a1ffeed8d4e6f075", "ja": "むしろ大喜びでプロデュースしてるさ。それにしても\n未来の亜美か……どんなアイドルになってたんだ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "72604825b4672d0ce2868130ed8092980f4fbec71a05762560e4d4d75d5458d8", "ja": "そりゃもう、歌もトークも泥んこ相撲もできちゃう\nスーパーアイドルに決まってるっしょ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "e4238f71b2f344b5eddfb2893953c662b4030c5f18ffab288ccf320e910918b4", "ja": "メチャ美人なのにタカネの花じゃなくってー。楽しくて\n面白くて。行く先々を爆笑のずんどこに叩き落とすよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1013_p", "source_sha256": "18e7128fa2ef69b6ffef06d1d0b9bb409b3de362b9c6031d8c221bce539c8411", "ja": "それは本当に、他に類を見ないスーパーアイドルだな。\n……だが、むしろ現実味がある。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a46a52790bf599eb85619944f44e2c54f303d21e8bb7b86e0c6886ecbf45c07d", "ja": "亜美の武器を的確に伸ばしていけば、\nそんなアイドルになるのは……夢じゃないぞ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "9419fb196f79b8bf2230909f6279823c3fb1e04db7edeee1500e96efaa211af8", "ja": "おっ、兄ちゃんもわかる～？　亜美がせくしーで\nぷりちーなのは間違いないけど。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "d2b12f79807f01b1dc4d2cba0505e35aebd8041957a5e3f02db2b01a12732fd0", "ja": "やっぱ楽しくなきゃ亜美じゃないっしょ！　バンジー\nジャンプも粉アメ探しも弾丸ロケもどんと来いだよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1017_p", "source_sha256": "aa75c78640b4be01bda6e80fd778cd7c4f51ce44aaa4c55e8930e77634b0c129", "ja": "うん。歌やダンスもがんばれとは思うけど、スキル全般\nを伸ばしていって、面白さもあればかなり強いかな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "1355b9add951c00e270fb16ed1f6dfd6ace80968c2f0acd2bd493bcd5679d23c", "ja": "うむ。でも、そんな成長を遂げるためには、亜美を自由\nにさせてくれる兄ちゃんの協力が必要なわけですよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "47242e6f93bc6a2802d382ae448cfc74cff49a7bb66096f75e1960416b0ecbc8", "ja": "というわけで……今、誓って兄ちゃん！\n亜美を一生プロデュースし続けるって！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5eabea10cda28d728661f71f77b598f21c084c55f117f02aaf6ac2c6a247cbf5", "ja": "って、なんでも自由にさせるわけじゃないからな？\nやんちゃはほどほどに頼むぞ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "efb907ab77f950d371660fd2f9ba8b4ac9f29ad9c79ef78fe089dc27c54271e1", "ja": "ちっ、ヌカにクギを刺されてしまったか。\n引き抜きにくいにっくきクギだぜ……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1022_p", "source_sha256": "997d1123407c31793f50cfd91c890f6d4c883f1d9aa8d5ebf598d48a7e1ff96d", "ja": "ただし、プロデュースは約束する。亜美がいいと\n言うまで、一緒にトップアイドルを目指し続けるから。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "43ed735ac18b9f027c7c209f252d51337e70dea6f421d556898838207dc73b7d", "ja": "兄ちゃん……！　その意気込み、しかと受け止めたよ！\nよし、亜美も一生、兄ちゃんにイタズラし続けるから！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8ccc8d87338ca83a385b903c5c15b100b0eeb777abaf64f5c5307c15c00c91e9", "ja": "いやだからイタズラは。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1025_011ami", "source_sha256": "289a0ad51b53dc41b5b7096a144c4739ffb2ed3c0acb462d9c060c8352f2bd92", "ja": "おっとスタッフさんが呼んでる！　それじゃあ兄ちゃん\n再び行ってきまーす！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7e69649d30bf057bdbfe1632d0141977ee77fc77a8e2c4d2fe16eda26f292c49", "ja": "あぁっ、撮影は終わっているのに！\n……まあ、すぐに戻ってくるだろう。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0574_1027_p", "source_sha256": "0e50b6e38e3b9fbdde4ef8f1c198f42bb71c15e4742320ee81372614da22fe0e", "ja": "（亜美の未来……明るくて楽しいスーパーアイドルは何\nも夢じゃない。一刻も早く近づけるよう……頑張ろう）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
